<title>USA: Competitive muni sales total $336 mln Thursday.</title>
<headline>Competitive muni sales total $336 mln Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled competitive municipal bond sales are expected to total $336 million in 17 offerings for Thursday, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>The largest issue is a $200 million Massachusetts Bay Transportation Authority issue at 1100 EDT.</p>
</text>
